{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05343","headline":"同韦舍人早朝 · 郑愔","name":"同韦舍人早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑞阙龙居峻，宸庭凤掖深。\n才良寄天綍，趋拜侣朝簪。\n飞马看来影，喧车识驻音。\n重轩轻雾入，洞户落花侵。\n闻有题新翰，依然想旧林。\n同声慙卞玉，谬此托韦金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}